member.example:
You could run updates on all models in a project from a given library file

void LoadLibraryAndRunUpdates(ISimioProject project, string libraryFileName)
{
    var library = project.Libraries.LoadFromFile(libraryFileName);
    foreach(var model in project.Models)
    {
        library.Update(model);
    }
}

You could just update all models in the project to the latest version of objects from all attached libraries

void UpdateEverything(ISimioProject project)
{
    foreach(var library in project.Libraries)
    {
        foreach(var model in project.Models)
        {
            library.Update(model);
        }
    }
}

